{"resourceIdentifier":"2652","resourceName":"HENAN YIYANG AFFORESTATION PROJECT","description":"Henan Yiyang Afforestation Project (hereafter referred as “the project”) is located in Yiyang\r\nCounty, Luoyang City, Henan Province, China. The project is to establish forest on the barren\r\nland to generate GHG emission reductions and contribute to local sustainable development. The\r\nproject is 13,634.73 ha of forest was established by direct planted on barren lands in Yiyang\r\nCounty, Luoyang City, Henan Province.\r\nThe project activity aims to:\r\n- Sequester carbon dioxide and mitigating climate change;\r\n- Enhance biodiversity conservation by increasing the connectivity of forests;\r\n- Improve the quality and quantity of the vegetation;\r\n- Improve soil and water conservation and contribute to sustainable development.\r\n- Generate income and job opportunities for local communities.\r\nThere is no natural renewal and reforestation and all sites were barren hills at least 10 years prior\r\nto the implementation of the project. The main objective specie are Robinia, Platycladus and Oak\r\nTree which are native species.\r\nWith the implementation of the project activity, total GHG emission reductions or removals are\r\nabout 16,662,626 tCO2e in 60 years the average annual emission reduction is 277,710 tCO2e\r\nand total GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is about 14,996,363 tCO2e\r\nin 60 years, the average annual GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is\r\n249,939 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":34.250000,"longitude":111.750000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-12-18","endExclusive":"2022-01-18","endInclusive":"2022-01-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2652"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","valu